If you want to repeat a tile multiple times using CSS, you can use the `background-repeat` property along with `background-size`. For example:

```css
.tile {
    background-image: url('path/to/your/tile.png');
    background-repeat: repeat; /* This will repeat the tile both horizontally and vertically */
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
}
```

If you need more control over the repetition, you can use `background-position` to place the tiles in specific positions.

### Using JavaScript

